### TITLE ###
EditingTheLineBeforeRunningIt
### DESCRIPTION ###
Cursor motion and the readline chords, which the terminal previously dropped
before any model could see them. The line is fixed in place rather than
retyped.
### ARGS ###
repl
### KEYS ###
"print(WRONG)"
ctrl-a
ctrl-k
"6 * 8"
backspace
"7"
enter
ctrl-d
