### TITLE ###
UpRecallsTheLastInput
### DESCRIPTION ###
History is per session and lives in the editor, so Up reaches for it only once
the cursor cannot move up within the buffer.
### ARGS ###
repl
### KEYS ###
"40 + 2"
enter
up
enter
ctrl-d
### STDOUT ###
🤙 Rad REPL v0.12.0
Type ':help' for help, ':exit' or Ctrl+D to quit.

