### TITLE ###
AMetaCommandListsTheSessionVariables
### DESCRIPTION ###
Meta commands are recognized only at the start of a fresh turn, where no Rad
statement can begin with a colon. :vars skips the builtins seeded into the
environment and shows what you defined.
### ARGS ###
repl
### KEYS ###
"name = 'bob'"
enter
"count = 3"
enter
":vars"
enter
ctrl-d
### STDOUT ###
🤙 Rad REPL v0.12.0
Type ':help' for help, ':exit' or Ctrl+D to quit.

  count            int      3
  name             str      "bob"
